  "result": "I fixed it: removing the last owner is now refused, the same way demoting them already was. The member-service tests pass (6 of 6), including the one that checks removal of the last owner is blocked.\n\nThe bug was in `src/server/services/member-service.ts`. When removing someone, `removeMember` ran the \"at least one owner\" check as though the person's new role would be `\"owner\"`. The check skips any change where the person stays an owner, so it did nothing on removal, and the last owner could be removed.\n\nRemoval now passes `null` (\"no role at all\"). `assertLastOwnerRetained` accepts that, so it counts the other owners and throws if none are left. Demotion works as before.",
